 examples, reinforcement learning in Markov Decision Processes, perceptron learning, and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":211863,"global_rank":261259,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40981},{"name":"booellean/Django-Playground","owner":"booellean","html_url":"https://github.com/booellean/Django-Playground","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A repository to track various experiments and tutorials from intermediate to advanced Django","topics":[],"score":211858,"global_rank":261270,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40982},{"name":"jschwarzwalder/Sort-XML","owner":"jschwarzwalder","html_url":"https://github.com/jschwarzwalder/Sort-XML","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Read in a file, process, export csv","topics":[],"score":211857,"global_rank":261286,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40983},{"name":"VeImore/Server","owner":"VeImore","html_url":"https://github.com/VeImore/Server","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211857,"global_rank":261293,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40984},{"name":"codynhat/mmpool","owner":"codynhat","html_url":"https://github.com/codynhat/mmpool","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211854,"global_rank":261297,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40985},{"name":"colobas/obras","owner":"colobas","html_url":"https://github.com/colobas/obras","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"hard difficult expert very tough","topics":[],"score":211854,"global_rank":261299,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":40986},{"name":"gabesk/osmrenderer","owner":"gabesk","html_url":"h